CRT-Sign-Web-Editor

This project is a fork of JR-Guidance-Sign-Web-Editor by endcreeper861:
https://github.com/endcreeper861/JR-Guidance-Sign-Web-Editor

The upstream project's Apache License, Version 2.0 is preserved in LICENSE.
This fork adds platform hanging signs and route maps, extends the guidance
sign editor, and prepares both editors for GitHub Pages. Modified source
files carry a change notice; the change summary is in docs/fork-changes.md.

Existing font and icon source attributions are preserved in README.md.
Third-party assets remain subject to their respective rights and licenses.
